    <string name="cocosations_network_check">Call channel check</string>
    <string name="cocosations_network_check_intro">The app requests STUN and TURN servers from your server (XEP-0215), gathers ICE candidates the same way as for a call and checks the channel over TURN via UDP, TCP and TLS. For each transport two test endpoints on the device connect through the server, and one sends the other a 6 second packet stream at voice rate. The traffic goes through the current VPN or proxy on the same ports as a relayed call. No call is made, the contact is not involved and the microphone stays off. After switching the proxy run the check again: the results are compared in a table.</string>
